{"author":{"id":"2eecc7d99b502c158aacb0868dca9358610edc02724d21fe49b0196402d3364e"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1787774728,"nonce":"RLqSt5d+zDoI2RpMuvUiTFBk/xo=","title":"docs: regenerate app screenshots with a neutral \"acme\" org","message":"\u003e Imported from pull request #55 (MERGED)\n\u003e Branch: `docs/screenshots-acme-shots` → `main`\n\u003e Created: 2026-07-22T15:39:46Z · Merged: 2026-07-22T16:03:52Z\n\n\nRe-captures the four UI screenshots with a **neutral `acme` org** so nothing org- or person-identifying ships in the published docs. Captured live via the fixture mode (`just ui-mock`, added in #54) and re-wired into both destinations.\n\n| Screen | Genericized |\n|--------|-------------|\n| Dashboard | org `acme`, repos `scarab`/`orders-api`/`inventory-svc`/`edge-gateway`/`billing`/`messaging`, avatar `AK` |\n| Run detail | author `a.kim` (was a real handle), org `acme` |\n| Environments | org `acme`, approvers `ops-lead, j.lee` |\n| Secrets | org `acme`, coverage matrix shows set/inherited/unset |\n\nReplaces:\n- `ui/scarab-docs-ui/src/assets/{dashboard,run-detail,environments,secrets}.jpg`\n- `docs/assets/screenshots/{dashboard,run-detail}-dark.jpg` (README)\n\n\nWhile capturing I found the fixture mode from #54 didn't actually work for the primary screens: the `openapi-fetch` client binds `globalThis.fetch` at module-eval time, which ran *before* `installMock()` because `App` was imported statically — so `/v1/me`, `/v1/repos`, `/v1/runs`, run status, etc. all escaped the mock. Fixed by installing the mock before dynamically importing `App`. (Commit `3386c7c`.)\n\n\n- All four re-rendered live in `just ui-mock` (dark), screenshots taken via the browser.\n- Docs site build passes: 124 pages, images optimized.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","files":null}]}